### 給 IntelliJ HTTP Client / VS Code REST Client 用（Windows 不想用 bash 時）

### 1. 取得 alice 的 token
# @name login
POST http://localhost:8080/realms/demo/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=copilot-web&username=alice&password=alice

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.access_token); %}

### 2. alice 的工單列表（只會看到指派給她的 T-1001、T-1003）
GET http://localhost:8083/api/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. 訂單 O-2001
GET http://localhost:8081/api/orders/O-2001
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. 貨件 S-3001（延誤中）
GET http://localhost:8082/api/shipments/S-3001
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. 越權：bob 的工單 → 403
GET http://localhost:8083/api/tickets/T-1002
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. 改寄到公司（寫入動作，之後要走人工審核）
POST http://localhost:8082/api/shipments/S-3001/redirect
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "newAddress": "台北市信義區松仁路 100 號 12 樓", "reason": "客人下週出差，改寄公司" }

### 7. 補償運費 60 元（alice 上限 100）
POST http://localhost:8083/api/tickets/T-1001/compensations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "SHIPPING_FEE_REFUND", "amount": 60, "reason": "物流延誤，補償改寄運費" }
